WEBVTT

0
00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:12.670
Hi,

1
00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:13.590
please take a seat.

2
00:00:19.989 --> 00:00:20.680
My name's Richard,

3
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:21.629
I'm from DASA,

4
00:00:21.709 --> 00:00:23.819
I'm here to do a drug and alcohol check on you today,

5
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.120
and you've been randomly selected for the test.

6
00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:27.739
How was I selected?

7
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.489
I was given the names of 30 people on site.

8
00:00:30.709 --> 00:00:32.729
I have a random number generator on my phone,

9
00:00:32.939 --> 00:00:34.490
and I selected 6 people.

10
00:00:34.669 --> 00:00:35.189
I see.

11
00:00:35.709 --> 00:00:36.770
Before proceeding,

12
00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:40.369
you'll be asked if you have had anything to eat or drink,

13
00:00:40.869 --> 00:00:44.709
or if you have used hand sanitizer in the last 15 minutes.

14
00:00:45.069 --> 00:00:48.049
This is to ensure that there is no interference with the test.

15
00:00:48.779 --> 00:00:49.810
If you have,

16
00:00:50.099 --> 00:00:51.979
the test will just be delayed.

17
00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.000
Before I get started,

18
00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:55.560
I'd need your written consent.

19
00:00:55.959 --> 00:00:56.080
Uh,

20
00:00:56.119 --> 00:00:58.000
have you got any photo identification on you,

21
00:00:58.119 --> 00:00:58.580
please?

22
00:00:59.549 --> 00:01:00.830
I have my driver's licence.

23
00:01:01.189 --> 00:01:01.830
Thank you.

24
00:01:11.839 --> 00:01:13.989
Would you please check that all the details are correct,

25
00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.559
and if you read that paragraph,

26
00:01:15.919 --> 00:01:17.059
sign and date.

27
00:01:17.919 --> 00:01:18.120
Sure.

28
00:01:20.239 --> 00:01:22.639
You are consenting to the testing.

29
00:01:23.419 --> 00:01:24.589
Read it carefully

30
00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:27.510
and ask if you are unsure about anything.

31
00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:29.959
If you need assistance or support,

32
00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:32.569
you may ask for somebody to be with you.

33
00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:39.110
Thank you.

34
00:01:43.629 --> 00:01:44.489
Is your lost inspector.

35
00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:45.209
Thanks.

36
00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:47.550
May I see under your tongue,

37
00:01:47.629 --> 00:01:48.099
please?

38
00:01:48.349 --> 00:01:48.690
Sure.

39
00:01:49.639 --> 00:01:50.349
Thank you.

40
00:01:51.349 --> 00:01:53.489
We will start the oral fluids test first.

41
00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.750
I'm going to collect a sample using a rapid screen kit.

42
00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.019
This kit complies with the Australia New Zealand standard.

43
00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:11.110
I collect the saliva oral fluid on this sponge,

44
00:02:11.399 --> 00:02:14.199
please take the handle and rub the sponge around on your gums,

45
00:02:14.279 --> 00:02:14.589
cheek,

46
00:02:14.619 --> 00:02:15.479
and under your tongue,

47
00:02:15.789 --> 00:02:17.899
the sponge needs to become quite saturated.

48
00:02:18.589 --> 00:02:18.949
OK.

49
00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:30.360
OK,

50
00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:32.250
if you put that in the top there for me please.

51
00:02:32.639 --> 00:02:33.179
Thank you.

52
00:02:34.509 --> 00:02:34.979
It looks good.

53
00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:37.889
Looks like there's plenty of oral fluid to make the test work.

54
00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:49.169
You can see how the fluid's moving up the test strip.

55
00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:50.550
Now,

56
00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.880
particular drug classes are amphetamines,

57
00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.039
methamphetamines,

58
00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:54.789
opiates,

59
00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:55.910
oxycodone,

60
00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:56.850
marijuana,

61
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:57.630
cocaine,

62
00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.199
and benzodiazepine.

63
00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:02.580
The V here it means that the test kit is working correctly.

64
00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.130
We're waiting to see lines appear,

65
00:03:05.169 --> 00:03:06.910
which means it's a negative result.

66
00:03:07.369 --> 00:03:08.869
And what happens if there's no line?

67
00:03:09.529 --> 00:03:10.330
If there's no lines,

68
00:03:10.369 --> 00:03:11.750
that means it's a non-negative,

69
00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:15.490
and we'll be doing a secondary test which goes away to a laboratory

70
00:03:15.809 --> 00:03:17.690
for analysis and confirmation.

71
00:03:19.309 --> 00:03:20.389
While that test is running,

72
00:03:20.589 --> 00:03:22.009
we'll do a breath alcohol test.

73
00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.770
This is similar to what the police use on the side of the road.

74
00:03:25.309 --> 00:03:26.149
For this work site,

75
00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.339
your breath alcohol limit is 0%.

76
00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:28.729
Um.

77
00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:44.330
OK,

78
00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:45.529
so take a deep breath,

79
00:03:45.729 --> 00:03:46.929
put your lips over the tube,

80
00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.449
blow until I say stop,

81
00:03:48.649 --> 00:03:49.240
you'll hear a beep,

82
00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:49.520
beep,

83
00:03:49.649 --> 00:03:49.880
beep.

84
00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:50.809
OK.

85
00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:56.110
Great,

86
00:03:56.229 --> 00:03:56.729
thank you.

87
00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:00.229
Here's your result,

88
00:04:00.309 --> 00:04:00.990
0%.

89
00:04:01.699 --> 00:04:03.160
I'll just note that on the paperwork.

90
00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:11.970
Your lines have appeared

91
00:04:12.149 --> 00:04:13.240
on the test results,

92
00:04:13.389 --> 00:04:14.110
you're all negative,

93
00:04:14.229 --> 00:04:15.929
so I'll note that on the paperwork as well.

94
00:04:26.429 --> 00:04:27.390
That's your copy,

95
00:04:27.709 --> 00:04:28.329
all good.

96
00:04:29.279 --> 00:04:30.179
Thank you very much.

97
00:04:31.489 --> 00:04:32.029
Thank you.